{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25948","headline":"秋怀五首 一 · 鲍溶","name":"秋怀五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促促生有涯，营营意无限。\n无限意未申，有涯生已晚。\n恩荣不可恃，天道归寸管。\n老如影随人，时若车下坂。\n行者归期尽，居人心更远。\n凉风日萧条，亲戚长在眼。\n多忧知无奈，圣贤莫能免。\n客鸟投本枝，生生复深浅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}